  "dct_description_sm": [
    "**ADAM ID: **[sm\\_us7000qa5h](https://api.adam.geospatial.wfp.org/api/collections/adam.adam_eq_events/items?uid=sm_us7000qa5h) Magnitude 5.6 earthquake at 515.379 depth occurred on Jul 02 2025 19km NW of Tuvuca. The epicentre of the earthquake was located at latitude -17.5875 longitude -178.9662. It impacted 2558 people within 50km. WFP’s Automated Disaster Analysis and Mapping (ADAM) system is an operational system for collecting, analysing and mapping geospatial and socio-economic information following sudden onset humanitarian emergencies."
